  "28eda0ab-8304-c242-827f-b9d27b67fac4"],
 "\[LineSeparator]is an option for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["DixonReconstruct",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/DixonReconstruct"]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"ab14b91c-5169-534b-8329-86222d00a3ec"],
 ". Defines at which Threshold the dixon reconstruction considers a voxel to \
be background noise. It is an absolute value of the first echo magnitude, \
default values is 0.1."
}], "Usage",
